{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f094a88a-538a-8225-8d2f-67b5c167dbf5",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T10:28:09-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Kwame Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:22:54-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:22:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning. Yeah, I'm calling about the snow at a bus stop. Can you hear me okay? I've only got one bar here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you fine. Go ahead, what's going on with the bus stop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:23:21-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's buried. The plow came through and pushed a wall of snow right over it, and now nobody can get to the curb. It's the stop right in front of 214 Memorial Boulevard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:23:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "214 Memorial Boulevard, down by Easton's Beach?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:23:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that side. Two-fourteen. [pause] Sorry, hold on, I'm stretching my back. Been shoveling since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:23:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. So the plow bank is blocking the bus stop itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:24:04-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It's about three feet high, packed and heavy, and now it's got that slush on top from the rain. How do I know it's going to get cleared? Is that something you folks do, or the bus company?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:24:26-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow piles along city streets are ours, so I'll put it in as a request to clear the bus stop. If the transit side has to do any of it, we'll pass it along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:24:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. But you'll put it in today? [line breaks up] Sorry, you cut out there. Today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm entering it as soon as we hang up, so it's in the list today. After a storm like Sunday into Monday the crews work through a long list, but bus stops get looked at."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:25:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And the other thing, it's all wet and then it's freezing overnight. Can somebody bring sand? The sidewalk there is ice under the slush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can request sand for that spot too. Is it the sidewalk, the street, or both that's slick?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:25:42-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the sidewalk and where people step off the curb to get to the bus. [pause] Hang on, let me straighten up again. Okay. The street's mostly bare, it's the curb area."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:26:00-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Curb area and sidewalk at the bus stop, 214 Memorial Boulevard, sand and clear the plow bank. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:26:13-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Say the address back once more, I want to be sure you've got two-fourteen and not two-forty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:26:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two-one-four Memorial Boulevard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:26:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And you'll sand it, not just look at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The request is for sand, so that's what the crew gets told. Whether they can get to it this morning or this afternoon depends on where they are, but it's on the sheet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:26:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Do you need my number in case they have a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:26:59-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead and give me one, just so we can reach you if the crew can't find the spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:27:11-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:27:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-seven. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:27:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And my name's Kwame Rahman. R-A-H-M-A-N."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:27:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Rahman. I have it all down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:27:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more check. If I call tomorrow and it's still buried, who do I ask for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:27:39-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call this same line and ask for Public Works. Mention the request for the bus stop at 214 Memorial and they can look it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:27:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That works. Thanks for your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:27:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Be careful on that ice, and go easy on the back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T10:28:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Bye."
    }
  ],
